  in1:"Meridian Labs needs somebody to lead how it uses AI. The last person to hold the job made a decision nobody could explain afterwards, and was never seen again. The desk is yours.",
  in2:"The city is the game. Two streets — Calle Principal and Calle Dos — an office with two floors, a bakery, a grocer's, a mechanic, a cleaning company, a notary and a woman with a pot on the corner. A tram runs between them and the map will take you anywhere. Anybody with a ❗ has something for you; walk up and talk, in any order you like.",
  in3:"Every call goes in your file — first try, second, or third. A wrong one earns you a verdict and another look; the quest stays open until you make the right call, and nothing you've built here is ever taken away. That file becomes a real report you can walk out with. Ladder: Junior → Delivery Lead → Senior Lead → AI Legend.",
