  goEpi:"Priya finds you in the parking lot. “Three bad calls and the floor stopped trusting you. That's the week — it isn't the job.” She taps the folder under her arm. “Nothing in here got closed. Same desk Monday, and this time you've read the Codex.”",
  mgoEpi:"Doña Chelo hands you a bag of pan dulce and does not ask for the keys. “You learned on my floor. That's what a floor is for.” What you finished, the mercado keeps. What you didn't is still on the counter in a folder with your handwriting on it, and the gate opens at seven, same as always.",
